    "commentsEn": "<ul>\r\n\t<li>The company signed a contract with a specialized company to perform engineering designs and supply equipment during mid-2009.</li>\r\n\t<li>The trial operation of the new production line with a capacity of 600 tons per day began in the second quarter of 2013.</li>\r\n\t<li>The commercial operation of the line started in October 2013.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
